# Frontend

- One studio page. Types in `src/types.ts`, HTTP in `src/api.ts`, view in `src/App.tsx`.
- Fonts: Fraunces (display) + Public Sans (UI). Colors from CSS variables in `index.css` (`--bg`, `--accent`). No Inter, no purple AI gradient.
- Poll `/jobs/{id}` every 1.5s until `done` or `failed`. Stills use `dataFileUrl()` → `/files/...`.
- Never label Ken Burns as I2V. If `artifacts.motion` exists, show that mode.
- Vite proxy: `/jobs`, `/health`, `/files` → `http://127.0.0.1:8765`. Bind `server.host` to `127.0.0.1`.
- Do not add a UI library unless the page truly needs it.
